# Only what deploy/Dockerfile needs enters the build context: never the local notes, the
# virtual environment, the dependencies installed for development or a previous build.
# At the root, where the legacy builder and BuildKit both read it.
*
!.python-version
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!web/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
**/__pycache__/
# Last, so that it wins over !src/ and !web/: local environment files, which Vite would read.
**/.env*
